FerrionOS changes to the Redox bootloader (MIT), made against f3d9261b5fc81418c259c5059f46ee7087e86ed8:
- the mode menu boots the highlighted mode after 3 seconds without a key, on UEFI;
- a failing SetAttribute no longer panics, which a serial port behind a socket triggered;
- the banners name FerrionOS.

